              </svg>
              ?ㅼ씠踰?釉붾줈洹?<span class="text-mood/60">??/span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/florix_studios" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-base text-text hover:text-accent transition-colors">
